{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5e9c3f2a-7b41-4f8d-9d2e-7c0a8e3f1b4c",
    "name": "TONBANKCARD Merchant API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the **TONBANKCARD Merchant API v1.0.0** — a stateless, non-custodial payment orchestration layer.\n\nThe API never holds private keys, never signs transactions and never moves funds. The blockchain is the single source of truth; all responses here are **informational** and must be re-verified on-chain before fulfilling orders.\n\n### Requirements\n\n- A merchant API key (`{{api_key}}`)\n- A whitelisted merchant NFT address (`{{merchant_nft}}`)\n- A target environment: testnet `https://api-testnet.tonbankcard.io/v1` or production `https://api.tonbankcard.io/v1`\n\n### Variables\n\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `base_url` | API base URL (testnet by default). |\n| `api_key` | Merchant API key (Bearer token). Keep it out of version control. |\n| `merchant_nft` | Merchant NFT address used in invoice creation. |\n| `amount_tbc` | Amount in TBC nanocoins (1 TBC = 10^9 nanocoins). |\n| `order_id` | Merchant-side order id; auto-generated when blank by the `pre-request` script. |\n| `invoice_id` | Populated automatically from `POST /invoice/create` response. |\n\n### Reference\n\n- Spec: [`docs/merchant-api-spec.md`](./merchant-api-spec.md)\n- Security: [`docs/merchant-api-security.md`](./merchant-api-security.md)\n- SDK: [`sdk/README.md`](../sdk/README.md)\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{api_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-generate an order_id for each request when not provided.",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('order_id')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', 'ORDER-' + Date.now().toString(36).toUpperCase());",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://api-testnet.tonbankcard.io/v1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "API base URL. Switch to https://api.tonbankcard.io/v1 for production."
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Merchant API key (Bearer). Never commit a real key to source control."
    },
    {
      "key": "merchant_nft",
      "value": "EQAjHkHtt1MIoU5c7dks73Rz8NMxAA3oStSrcQ_qgn3il-Le",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Merchant NFT address (Series 7777 example from the spec)."
    },
    {
      "key": "amount_tbc",
      "value": "1000000000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Amount in TBC nanocoins (1 TBC = 10^9 nanocoins)."
    },
    {
      "key": "order_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Order id; auto-generated by the pre-request script when empty."
    },
    {
      "key": "invoice_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Populated automatically from the POST /invoice/create response."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Invoices",
      "description": "Stateless invoice orchestration endpoints. Invoices are pure metadata; settlement happens on-chain in the `MerchantPaymentHub` contract.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create invoice",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchant_nft\": \"{{merchant_nft}}\",\n  \"amount_tbc\": \"{{amount_tbc}}\",\n  \"currency\": \"TBC\",\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"order_id\": \"{{order_id}}\",\n    \"description\": \"Premium subscription (1 month)\"\n  },\n  \"expires_at\": \"2025-12-31T23:59:59Z\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/invoice/create",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["invoice", "create"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new payment intent (invoice). Idempotent within the expiry window: identical input produces the same `invoice_id`.\n\n**Limits**\n\n- `amount_tbc`: positive integer, ≤ 2^120 − 1\n- `metadata`: ≤ 10 fields, ≤ 1 KB total\n\nReturns `201 Created` with the canonical invoice and a `payment_url` deep link for the wallet."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 201 Created', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('response contains invoice_id', function () {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('invoice_id').that.is.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('invoice_id', json.invoice_id);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('status is pending and amount echoes input', function () {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('pending');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.amount_tbc).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('amount_tbc'));",
                  "  pm.expect(json.currency).to.eql('TBC');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer YOUR_API_KEY" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"merchant_nft\": \"EQAjHkHtt1MIoU5c7dks73Rz8NMxAA3oStSrcQ_qgn3il-Le\",\n  \"amount_tbc\": \"1000000000\",\n  \"currency\": \"TBC\",\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"order_id\": \"ORDER-12345\",\n    \"description\": \"Premium subscription (1 month)\"\n  },\n  \"expires_at\": \"2025-12-31T23:59:59Z\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
